<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Complete Your First Investment — Agri-Fi</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f6f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f4f6f8;padding:24px 0;">
    <tr><td align="center">
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;padding:32px;">
        <tr><td style="font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#166534;padding-bottom:16px;">Agri-Fi</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:12px;">{{userName}}, make your first investment today 🚀</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="font-size:14px;line-height:22px;">
          <p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">You signed up a week ago and we'd love to see you make your first investment. Deals are closing fast — don't miss your chance to participate.</p>

          <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:6px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:16px;">
            <tr>
              <td style="font-size:14px;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-weight:bold;color:#166534;">Why start today?</p>
                <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:18px;">
                  <li style="margin-bottom:4px;">Deals accept tokens from as little as $100</li>
                  <li style="margin-bottom:4px;">Returns distributed automatically on delivery</li>
                  <li style="margin-bottom:4px;">Your funds protected in Stellar escrow</li>
                  <li style="margin-bottom:4px;">Real-time shipment tracking on-chain</li>
                </ul>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>

          <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Complete KYC verification in under 5 minutes, then browse the marketplace and fund your first deal.</p>

          <p style="margin:20px 0;">
            <a href="{{appUrl}}/marketplace" style="display:inline-block;background:#16a34a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;">Make My First Investment</a>
          </p>

          <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;">Need help? Reply to this email or visit our <a href="{{appUrl}}/help" style="color:#6b7280;">Help Centre</a>.</p>
        </td></tr>
        <tr><td style="font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;">
          <p style="margin:0 0 4px 0;">{{companyName}} &middot; {{physicalAddress}}</p>
          <p style="margin:0;"><a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}" style="color:#9ca3af;font-size:11px;">Unsubscribe from these emails</a></p>
        </td></tr>
      </table>
    </td></tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
